stateDiagram-v2
    %% CURRENT implementation; sources and guards in transition inventory.
    state "available: unconsumed, before deadline" as available
    state "consumed_at present" as consumed
    state "expired (derived; no stored status)" as expired
    [*] --> available
    available --> consumed: store.consume!
    available --> consumed: store.delete
    expired --> consumed: store.delete
    consumed --> consumed: store.delete
    available --> expired: clock reaches deadline
    consumed --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
